bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Reset Password UI" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
control JwtService
control UserService
boundary HashUtil
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Submit new password + verification code
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /auth/verify-forgot-password
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. verificationForgotPassword(code, password)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. verificationForgotPassword(token, password)
activate AuthService

opt Missing token
    AuthService --> AuthController: 4.1. BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 4.2. Return error
    Router --> UI: 4.3. Return error
    UI --> User: 4.4. Show error
end

AuthService -> JwtService: 5. verify(token)
activate JwtService
opt Invalid / expired token
    JwtService --> AuthService: 5.1. Return error
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.2. BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.3. Return error
    Router --> UI: 5.4. Return error
    UI --> User: 5.5. Show error
end
JwtService --> AuthService: 6. payload
deactivate JwtService

opt Invalid payload
    AuthService --> AuthController: 6.1. BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 6.2. BadRequestException
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Return error
    UI --> User: 6.4. Show error
end

ref over AuthService, MongoDB: 7. Subsequence - Find user for Password Recovery

loop User invalid / banned / google / not verified / Verification code mismatch
    AuthService --> AuthController: 7.1. BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 7.2. Return error
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Return error
    UI --> User: 7.4. Show error
end

ref over AuthService, MongoDB: 8. Subsequence - Update new password

opt Update failed
    AuthService --> AuthController: 8.1. BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 8.2. Return error
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Return error
    UI --> User: 8.4. Show error
end

AuthService --> AuthController: 9. success response
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 10. HTTP response
deactivate AuthController
Router --> UI: 11. Show success message
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. Password updated successfully
deactivate UI
deactivate User